/*
 * Implements the finalization phase for class symbols.
 *
 * This module handles:
 *   - validation of methods added during class construction,
 *   - validation of constructors and destructors,
 *   - aggregation of validation errors across all added members,
 *   - insertion of finalized class generators into the validation context,
 *   - error propagation for template classes.
 *
 * Class finalization occurs after all class members have been declared and
 * prototype-validated. This phase ensures that:
 *   - all added methods are semantically validated,
 *   - all constructors and destructors are validated,
 *   - template classes propagate finalization errors,
 *   - the class generator is inserted into the context.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::symbol::class_::finalize
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/symbol/class_/finalize.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created(YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-05-27
 * @Copyright(C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
